A new batch of farmers and students has completed the Organic Agriculture Production NCII assessment at Cortijo de Palsabangon Farm OPC's TESDA Registered Farm School and Assessment Center.

The cohort spent several weeks on hands-on training across the working farm before sitting the national certification assessment — the latest group to graduate from the program since the farm school's accreditation.
